# Rule: ComplexModulusCoordinates
# Before (rejected):
# forall z C:
#     sqrt(re(z)^2+img(z)^2)=C_abs(z)
# Former behavior: strict run success=false, phase search_proof.
# Now (verified directly):
forall z C:
    sqrt(re(z)^2+img(z)^2)=C_abs(z)

forall z C:
    C_abs(z)=sqrt(re(z)^2+img(z)^2)

forall z C:
    0<=re(z)^2+img(z)^2
    C_abs(z)=sqrt(re(z)^2+img(z)^2)

# Boundary: Principal nonnegative modulus; altered signs, powers and coordinate subjects reject.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/complex_modulus_coordinates_symbolic.lit
